ise i'll open a separated issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2586782772/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2586847367","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100775#issuecomment-2586847367","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100775","id":2586847367,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aMCiH","user":{"login":"em-s-h","id":120836609,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzPSAQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120836609?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/em-s-h","html_url":"https://github.com/em-s-h","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/em-s-h/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/em-s-h/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/em-s-h/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/em-s-h/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/em-s-h/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/em-s-h/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/em-s-h/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/em-s-h/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/em-s-h/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-13T11:25:27Z","updated_at":"2025-01-13T11:25:27Z","body":"@matheusmdx I wasn't able to reproduce this crash in 4.1.2 or 4.1.1","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2586847367/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]